---
expect: accept
---

# The generated index is exempt from the filename rule

`memory/index/*.md` is written by `scripts/regenerate-indexes.sh`, so the first
rejection path skips it. This is the carve-out a rewrite of that path is most
likely to drop: the naive "every file under memory/ must be memory.md" rule is
shorter, still rejects `stray-filename`, and turns every index regeneration into
a blocked push.
